int probe matrix was NOT completed (template-lab audit/overflow/print probes are configured for a CI/Linux Chromium and LAB_BASE:3000); PDF-vs-DOCX parity was NOT audited; field-by-field DOM verification of the heading sync was not performed. No intentional re-baseline was taken - if you want the pagination rule INSIDE the frozen sheet that needs an explicit re-baseline authorisation and I will also update INV-1 with your sign-off. Doc: .bridge/evidence/dir061-implementation-evidence.md."
